<title>LITHUANIA: CONSTRUCTION PRICES UP BY 0.7 PCT IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>CONSTRUCTION PRICES UP BY 0.7 PCT IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's statistics department said on Tuesday that construction prices rose by 0.7 percent in June month-on-month and 10.4 percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that construction prices increased 10.4 percent in the first six months of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
